  ('england', 'Leicestershire', '2026-27', 'October half term', '2026-10-17'::date, '2026-10-25'::date, 'https://www.leicestershire.gov.uk/education-and-children/schools-colleges-and-academies/school-term-dates', 'Page "Term dates 2026/2027", "Autumn Term": "Schools open: Monday 24 August 2026"; "August Bank Holiday: Monday 31 August 2026"; "Half term break: Monday 19 to Friday 23 October 2026"; "Schools close: Friday 18 December 2026". Last school day before half term Fri 16 Oct 2026; return Mon 26 Oct 2026. Page: "The law requires local authority schools to have 190 school days, however some schools follow a different term-time pattern." and "Please check with your child''s school website to ensure you have the correct pattern and have noted any inset/teacher training days as these are determined by the school." starts_on/ends_on derived: day after last school day / day before pupils return. Checked 2026-11-02. Second source: an earlier independent read of the same council page gives the same dates (checked 2026-11-02).'),
