  ('england', 'Hampshire', '2028-29', 'October half term', '2028-10-21'::date, '2028-10-29'::date, 'https://democracy.hants.gov.uk/documents/s126360/School%20Term%20and%20Holiday%20Dates%20for%202028-29%20-%20Decision%20Report.pdf', '''Autumn Term 2028 starts on Monday 4 September 2028 and ends on Wednesday 20 December 2028 (Half term from Monday 23 October to Friday 27 October 2028)''; calendar 20# Fri 20 Oct, 30* Mon 30 Oct. Last school day Fri 20 Oct 2028; pupils return Mon 30 Oct 2028. Hampshire decision report ''School Term and Holiday Dates for 2028-29'', Appendix 2 (calendar, # = ''Last day before break'', * = ''First day after break'') and term table. Decision page democracy.hants.gov.uk ID 3937 shows ''Recommendations Approved'' (25/10/2024), read by a research agent. Read from Adalbert''s phone screenshots of the PDF, 2026-11-02; text summary, term table and calendar marks agree.'),
